- **CI on `9956048b4c`:** 40 check runs, none failed.
- **Acceptance notes:**
  - `resolveMetaWriteActor`'s docblock still mentions a `'system'` default, stale since #4556 (doc drift);
  - `FileSystemRepositoryOptions.fsActor` has no producer, and retiring it would narrow an exported type, so it stays;
